WEBVTT


00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.100
Remember, if you thought Korean sunscreens are good,

00:00:02.101 --> 00:00:03.901
Japanese sunscreens are even better.

00:00:03.902 --> 00:00:07.141
99% of Korean sunscreens are only good for everyday wear,

00:00:07.142 --> 00:00:10.421
whereas most Japanese sunscreens are made to hold up better outdoors.

00:00:10.422 --> 00:00:12.061
These are my top Japanese sunscreens.

00:00:12.062 --> 00:00:14.181
They have those Korean sunscreen textures

00:00:14.182 --> 00:00:15.941
but with water sweat resistant.

00:00:15.942 --> 00:00:18.621
Everyone has seen this dewy gel lotion and honestly,

00:00:18.622 --> 00:00:21.981
it deserves all the hype. Insanely thin and surprisingly matte.

00:00:21.982 --> 00:00:24.341
This is a matte milky sunscreen I trust the most

00:00:24.342 --> 00:00:26.341
for any outdoor activity or condition.

00:00:26.342 --> 00:00:28.661
The budget friendly heavy duty alternative,

00:00:28.662 --> 00:00:31.741
a refreshingly light gel lotion that gives a natural finish,

00:00:31.742 --> 00:00:33.781
just a little more rich and moisturizing.

00:00:33.782 --> 00:00:35.701
A watery gel that dries down

00:00:35.702 --> 00:00:39.801
fresh but natural. Similar but noticeably thicker and more emollient.

00:00:39.802 --> 00:00:43.061
This light watery gel lotion is a hidden gem no one talks about.

00:00:43.062 --> 00:00:46.261
This is also juicy and watery but gives a more dewy finish.

00:00:46.262 --> 00:00:48.901
Similar but a little more creamy and moisturizing.

00:00:48.902 --> 00:00:52.201
A rich gel cream that leaves your skin glossy and moisturized.

00:00:52.202 --> 00:00:54.061
It starts creamy then turns powdery,

00:00:54.062 --> 00:00:56.061
leaving your skin feeling smooth and matte.

00:00:56.062 --> 00:00:57.301
This is the black sheep.

00:00:57.302 --> 00:00:59.868
It's the only one that's fragrance and alcohol free.
